WEBVTT

00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:04.420
I activate the effect of Scarlight 
Red Dragon Archfiend.

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:05.900
Once per turn,

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:09.780
it can destroy all monsters with attack 
points equal to, or lower, than its own.

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:13.430
Absolute Power Flame!

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:29.810
And each monster destroyed 
deals 500 damage to you!

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:33.180
Jack destroyed seventeen monsters!

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:35.180
500 points times 17 is...

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:36.650
8500?

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:38.040
Yuya!

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:39.560
Did Yuya lose?

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:40.350
Oh, no!

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:42.550
No, Yuya is...

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:49.290
I activated Action Spell Acceleration 
and negated the damage!

00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:53.500
Yuya's safe! He managed to make it through!

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:54.940
Yes!

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:55.970
Thank goodness!

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:58.940
He scared me for a minute, there...

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:01.370
It's too early to breathe easy.

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:04.440
You may have avoided the effect, 
but you won't escape!

00:01:05.110 --> 00:01:06.310
Battle.

00:01:06.310 --> 00:01:09.440
Go, Scarlight Red Dragon Archfiend.

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:12.350
Attack Yuya Sakaki directly.

00:01:12.350 --> 00:01:15.530
Red Hot Crimson Hell Burning!

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:18.880
Jack isn't letting up!

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:25.880
I activate my Action Spell Damage Draw!

00:01:26.490 --> 00:01:29.100
When I take 2000 or more battle damage,

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:30.980
I can draw two cards!

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:34.200
You survived, eh?

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:38.280
But blindly drawing cards 
won't accomplish anything!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:41.980
I set one card and end my turn!

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:44.620
Jack has made it very clear

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:48.950
that not even the Public Order Bureau's 
director will stop this duel.

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:51.160
Shut up!

00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:52.350
What?!

00:01:52.350 --> 00:01:54.360
Director, an unexpected development.

00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:57.740
Duelists, believed to be Lancers, 
have infiltrated our headquarters,

00:01:57.740 --> 00:01:59.130
and are battling the guards.

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:00.900
What?

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:05.370
I attack Goyo Defender with 
Frightfur Chimera!

00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:10.340
Twilight Ninja Getsuga, the Shogun 
attacks Goyo Predator!

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:23.900
Even if we one-turn kill their 
allies, they don't flinch.

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:25.160
Have they no emotions?

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:29.510
They must be brainwashed 
and under Roget's control.

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:31.800
If we want to save Yuzu...

00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:35.060
...we must first cure their brainwashing!

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.470
D-Wheels.

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:42.760
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:44.480
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:47.900
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:50.060
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:28.980
Nirvana High Paladin

00:04:29.340 --> 00:04:32.950
Despite taking big damage, 
Yuya still made it through!

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:36.660
But what's wrong? It's your turn, you know!

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:45.060
All this time, I've been working 
to make Dad's duels my own.

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:47.380
Don't speak to me with borrowed words.

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:51.040
If you want to talk to me, 
speak with your own words.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:53.270
With your duel!

00:04:53.780 --> 00:04:58.280
I believed that Dad's entertainment duels 
were the best duels possible.

00:04:58.280 --> 00:05:02.510
What's wrong? Still dreaming about your father?

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:07.280
If you don't want to fight, just surrender 
and get out of my sight.

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:09.490
You can't duel, half-asleep!

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:12.690
I'll never surrender!

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:16.660
If I run away now, I'll be rejecting Dad's duel.

00:05:16.660 --> 00:05:20.260
Anyway, now I'll give all I've got, 
with what I have!

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:22.630
My turn!

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:33.160
I Pendulum Summon with the scale already set!

00:05:34.050 --> 00:05:37.790
Return from my Extra Deck, 
Timebreaker Magician!

00:05:39.320 --> 00:05:42.490
You, too, Performapal Radish Horse!

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:47.790
And I Normal Summon Tuning 
Magician from my hand!

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:52.730
Tuning Magician?

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:56.620
When I successfully summon this card,

00:05:56.620 --> 00:06:01.300
it restores 400 life points to you, 
and I take 400 damage.

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:08.330
When you recover life points,

00:06:08.330 --> 00:06:12.540
I can Special Summon Performapal 
Life Swordsman!

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:23.590
This card's attack points are equal to the 
number of life points you recovered!

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:29.850
I also use the effect of Radish Horse, 
with 500 attack points,

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:34.280
to decrease Scarlight Red Dragon 
Archfiend's attack points by 500.

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:39.030
And Life Swordsman's attack points 
increase by the same amount!

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:44.750
Jack, you said I haven't grown at all.

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:47.830
Not at all, since I fought you 
in the preliminaries!

00:06:48.490 --> 00:06:52.190
But using your card I got from Sam,

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:56.430
Tuning Magician, I have learned this 
dimension's summoning method!

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:58.540
Then show it to me.

00:06:58.540 --> 00:07:03.130
Does the power you've acquired make 
you worthy to stand before the king?

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:08.650
Level 1 Tuning Magician tunes 
Level 4 Radish Horse

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:11.530
and Level 3 Timebreaker Magician!

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:15.820
Sword of the hero that puts out gallant light...

00:07:15.820 --> 00:07:18.480
Awaken now, in a flash of light!

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:21.420
Synchro Summon!

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:27.620
Level 8 Enlightenment Paladin!

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:34.730
Yuya's Synchro Monster, which taught me 
that there are no worthless cards.

00:07:35.230 --> 00:07:37.470
Enlightenment Paladin's monster effect

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:43.440
lets me return Smile World from my 
graveyard, and add it to my hand!

00:07:44.920 --> 00:07:49.370
I'm grateful to you for giving 
me Synchro Monsters.

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:52.300
But I won't reject my father's duels...

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:53.120
Never!

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:58.720
I tribute the 900-attack-point Life Swordsman

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:04.900
to increase Enlightenment Paladin's attack points 
by an equal amount, until my End Phrase.

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:12.840
Battle! Enlightenment Paladin attacks 
Scarlight Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:08:13.770 --> 00:08:16.350
I activate my trap Red Gem.

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:19.240
Red monsters cannot be destroyed this turn!

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:23.930
Although he took damage,

00:08:23.930 --> 00:08:28.190
Jack protected his symbol, Red Dragon!

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:32.160
This... This is how the king duels!

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:34.490
Damn! I end my turn!

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:38.380
In that instant, Radish Horse's effect ends,

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:40.730
and Red Dragon's attack points return to normal.

00:08:41.300 --> 00:08:43.480
Enlightenment Paladin's attack points,

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:46.700
increased by Life Swordsman's effect, 
also return to normal!

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:49.410
Jack sure is stubborn...

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:53.080
He rejected Yuya's father's entertainment duels

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:57.550
and deflected the Synchro Monster 
Yuya summoned with Jack's card.

00:08:57.840 --> 00:09:00.420
Does Yuya have another trick up his sleeve?

00:09:01.190 --> 00:09:04.270
Tuning Magician was borrowed, too.

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:06.660
How do I fight my own duel?

00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:10.170
Enlightenment? Nonsense.

00:09:10.170 --> 00:09:13.940
Your only path is the one where 
you bow before the king.

00:09:14.350 --> 00:09:16.130
My turn!

00:09:16.130 --> 00:09:18.100
Red Dragon's effect

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:22.640
destroys all Special Summoned monsters 
with 3000 or fewer attack points.

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:25.080
Absolute Power Flame!

00:09:25.650 --> 00:09:28.780
I activate the Pendulum Effect of 
Performapal Bubblebowwow!

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:32.520
It destroys itself to negate a destruction effect!

00:09:34.820 --> 00:09:37.490
Yuya protected his monsters, too!

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:39.400
Then, battle!

00:09:39.400 --> 00:09:44.410
Scarlight Red Dragon Archfiend 
attacks Enlightenment Paladin.

00:09:44.410 --> 00:09:47.590
Red Hot Crimson Hell Burning!

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:52.800
I activate the Pendulum Effect of 
Performapal Gumgumouton!

00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:56.040
Once per turn, I can negate destruction by battle.

00:09:58.980 --> 00:10:01.010
But you still take the damage.

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:06.950
Yuya's life is down to 100!

00:10:07.320 --> 00:10:10.690
I set one card and end my turn.

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:14.100
You protected it with Pendulum Effects?

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:17.300
We'll see if that will be your breakthrough.

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:31.750
Fear not. I used the back of my sword.

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:36.810
There's no mistake! This is the core 
for the control system!

00:10:37.760 --> 00:10:39.780
Spell card Art of Katon.

00:10:43.730 --> 00:10:44.780
Alarms?

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:47.730
Have the rioting Commons 
reached this place, as well?

00:10:48.800 --> 00:10:51.900
What are you doing?! 
Capture the invaders at once!

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:53.700
You should have plenty of hands!

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:56.590
Team coordination has been compromised,

00:10:56.590 --> 00:10:58.400
and they've begun to act separately.

00:10:58.690 --> 00:10:59.800
It cannot be.

00:11:00.610 --> 00:11:03.240
The control system was destroyed?

00:11:08.720 --> 00:11:10.190
What have I been doing?

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:10.920
Where are we?

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:12.620
Get them!

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:14.850
Crush them!

00:11:15.670 --> 00:11:19.060
While Jack and Yuya have been 
engaged in fiery combat,

00:11:19.060 --> 00:11:23.030
in the city, the Commons 
have security on the run.

00:11:26.230 --> 00:11:29.100
Hey! Stop that stuff, everyone.

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:31.930
Focus on the duel!

00:11:31.930 --> 00:11:34.670
At this rate, the Commons' riots will escalate.

00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:37.380
All Lancers, follow me.

00:11:38.020 --> 00:11:39.740
Are you gonna beat up the Commons?

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:41.180
Even Crow and Shinji?

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:42.580
Don't do it!

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:44.220
Don't worry.

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:49.050
We may be strong, but we'd never 
suppress others with our power.

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:52.440
We're just going to stop the fighting.

00:11:52.760 --> 00:11:55.410
That's why we came here.

00:11:55.410 --> 00:11:56.660
Not just in City,

00:11:56.940 --> 00:12:00.030
but to end the fighting in all dimensions.

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:01.540
Layra?

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:07.450
Yuya is fighting his hardest to make 
everyone smile with his duel.

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:10.580
I want you to watch over our battle.

00:12:11.190 --> 00:12:15.110
The battle to bring peace to the world.

00:12:16.530 --> 00:12:20.220
Seems they're the saviors of this town of ours.

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:21.290
Saviors?

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:23.240
I'll watch over you...

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:28.280
To see where our City, our world, 
will go in the future.

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:38.960
You protected it with Pendulum Effects?

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:42.110
We'll see if that will be your breakthrough.

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:44.810
Pendulum? My breakthrough?

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:48.580
Since you're the first to open Pendulum's door,

00:12:48.980 --> 00:12:51.580
become the example for everyone to follow!

00:12:51.960 --> 00:12:56.390
That's right... I'm the first person to 
ever use Pendulum Summoning.

00:12:57.800 --> 00:13:01.410
Pendulum isn't something I borrowed from anyone.

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:02.920
It's my own word!

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:17.320
I see them, Jack...

00:13:17.320 --> 00:13:18.680
My own words!

00:13:18.930 --> 00:13:21.560
Then shout at me with those words!

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:23.380
With your own duel!

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:28.660
My turn!

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:36.520
I set the Pendulum Scale with Gumgumouton 
and Xiangke Magician!

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:47.960
Now I can summon monsters 
of Level 2 simultaneously!

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:51.140
Swing, my soul's pendulum.

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:53.720
Draw a shining arc in the sky!

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:55.790
Pendulum Summon!

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:56.900
Appear!

00:13:58.570 --> 00:14:00.490
Performapal Cheermole!

00:14:01.710 --> 00:14:03.750
Just hold on. It's coming.

00:14:04.550 --> 00:14:09.590
Level 8 Enlightenment Paladin 
tunes Level 2 Cheermole!

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:14.230
What? Enlightenment Paladin is not a Tuner.

00:14:14.590 --> 00:14:17.440
I have a monster that can 
be Synchro Summoned

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:22.770
by tributing a Pendulum Summoned 
Pendulum Monster and Synchro Monster!

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:24.240
What?

00:14:24.490 --> 00:14:29.210
From beyond the time of peace, releasing light 
to the world, far and wide...

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:30.810
Be reborn!

00:14:35.590 --> 00:14:37.050
Synchro Summon!

00:14:37.630 --> 00:14:43.830
Appear, Level 10 Nirvana High Paladin!

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:50.270
Wow! By accomplishing a Pendulum Summon,

00:14:50.270 --> 00:14:54.440
Yuya was able to Synchro Summon 
without a Tuner Monster!

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:56.280
Interesting.

00:14:56.280 --> 00:14:59.180
Yuya Sakaki, you are interesting, after all!

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:04.510
My Nirvana High Paladin attacks 
Scarlight Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:15.130
Truth Sukhavati!

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:24.310
I activate my Continuous Trap King Scarlet!

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:30.540
It negates Scarlight Red Dragon 
Archfiend's destruction,

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:35.400
and Special Summons King Scarlet, 
which acts as a Tuner Monster!

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:38.430
Another surprise!

00:15:38.430 --> 00:15:44.460
Jack negated the destruction and Special 
Summoned a trap as a Tuner Monster!

00:15:45.510 --> 00:15:47.190
I now end my turn.

00:15:47.190 --> 00:15:48.990
Yuya and Jack both...

00:15:48.990 --> 00:15:50.400
They're amazing!

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:52.240
They each keep mounting comebacks.

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:54.600
Like a constant clash of swords!

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:56.570
A truly worthy final match.

00:15:56.570 --> 00:15:58.540
You can't take your eyes off it!

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:03.010
You've finally begun to talk, I see, 
with your own words.

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:06.200
Then I'll answer you with my own duel!

00:16:07.840 --> 00:16:08.660
Jack!

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:10.790
My turn!

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:16.020
I summon Tuner Monster Mirror Resonator!

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:18.890
Two Tuner Monsters?

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:20.880
What will King do?

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:24.120
Oh, no! King has no road ahead!

00:16:24.840 --> 00:16:25.700
Jack!

00:16:26.550 --> 00:16:28.930
I'll make my own road.

00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:31.900
Listen to the beat of my soul.

00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:34.870
Do you feel it? The exhilaration of my life!

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:37.840
Behold! This is my duel...

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:41.670
The cry of the champion that 
challenges all, without rest!

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:43.550
He flew!

00:16:43.970 --> 00:16:48.830
Level 1 King Scarlet and Mirror Resonator

00:16:48.830 --> 00:16:52.410
Double Tune Level 8 Scarlight 
Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:54.260
Double Tune?

00:16:54.260 --> 00:16:55.490
No way!

00:16:55.750 --> 00:16:59.000
Champion and demon, merge here and now!

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:03.420
Touch the red dragon's soul and raise the 
cry that creates heaven and earth!

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:05.900
Synchro Summon!

00:17:08.650 --> 00:17:14.750
Appear! Level 10 Tyrant Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:22.900
Jack's symbol has been further 
powered up by Double Tuning!

00:17:25.300 --> 00:17:27.860
Incredible, Jack!

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:30.590
This is King's power?

00:17:30.930 --> 00:17:33.580
Jack is still evolving.

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:38.970
So the King of Duelists that he embodies may 
not be the pinnacle that the title can reach.

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:42.200
He acts arrogant,

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:47.550
but maybe it's just annoyance at not having 
someone to drive him to greater heights.

00:17:47.860 --> 00:17:50.110
And now, that person has finally appeared.

00:17:53.480 --> 00:17:56.450
Tyrant Red Dragon Archfiend's effect activates!

00:17:56.450 --> 00:18:01.030
Once per turn, I destroy all cards, except it!

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:03.750
Absolute Power Inferno!

00:18:08.430 --> 00:18:11.400
Everything? Including the Pendulum Cards?

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:15.870
In that instant, Nirvana High Paladin's 
monster effect activates!

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:19.610
I set the destroyed card in my Pendulum Zone.

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:23.510
Battle!

00:18:23.840 --> 00:18:27.940
Tyrant Red Dragon Archfiend attacks directly.

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:31.560
Inferno Crimson Hell Tide!

00:18:33.730 --> 00:18:36.230
I activate my Action Spell Evade!

00:18:36.230 --> 00:18:37.560
I negate the attack!

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:39.740
When Tyrant attacks,

00:18:39.740 --> 00:18:43.770
I can negate the activation of all 
spell cards and destroy them!

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:49.480
And that increases its attack points by 500.

00:18:50.040 --> 00:18:52.760
When the activation of a spell card is negated,

00:18:52.760 --> 00:18:57.500
I can Special Summon Acrobatic Magician 
from my hand, in defense position!

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:07.960
Then, Tyrant Red Dragon Archfiend 
attacks Acrobatic Magician!

00:19:13.280 --> 00:19:15.420
The destroyed Acrobatic Magician's effect

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:18.700
also sets it in the Pendulum 
Zone when it's destroyed!

00:19:20.850 --> 00:19:23.120
So you were prepared for this?

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:26.080
I set one card and end my turn!

00:19:26.480 --> 00:19:28.910
No, I wasn't prepared for it.

00:19:28.910 --> 00:19:31.880
I'm just doing everything I can, 
with what I have!

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:33.780
That just makes it more interesting.

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:38.260
It means you've finally begun 
to convey your will to me.

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:40.220
My will?

00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:43.950
Yes, a duel is a conversation with an opponent.

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:46.820
It's okay to learn the words that 
you use from someone else.

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:50.700
What's important is that, no matter 
how much you use those words,

00:19:50.700 --> 00:19:53.160
you communicate your will to your opponent.

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:55.910
Such is the core of dueling!

00:19:55.910 --> 00:19:58.490
It's okay to learn the words from others...

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:03.610
It's true that my dad first taught me 
those words, how to duel.

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:07.350
But I didn't only learn from Dad.

00:20:07.840 --> 00:20:12.160
The principal, Mom, Gongenzaka, Yuzu.

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:14.860
Everyone I've fought...

00:20:16.740 --> 00:20:21.170
A true king must be able to bear the feelings 
of the losers on his shoulders, as well.

00:20:21.420 --> 00:20:25.960
That's it. Win or lose, duels have raised me.

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:29.820
The duel I'm fighting now wasn't 
created by me alone!

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:37.190
Because...

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:43.320
Because everyone was with me,

00:20:46.700 --> 00:20:48.460
I was able to come this far.

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:53.080
And the Pendulum Summon I used at the start

00:20:53.630 --> 00:20:57.640
wasn't evolved to this degree 
through my power alone.

00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:01.720
I understand, Jack!

00:21:01.720 --> 00:21:06.490
I understand what a duel that isn't borrowed, 
which isn't just self-satisfaction, is!

00:21:07.100 --> 00:21:08.550
My turn!

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:14.920
My Pendulum Zones are set with 
Scale 2 Acrobatic Magician

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:18.490
and Scale 8 Nirvana High Paladin.

00:21:18.760 --> 00:21:22.960
Now I can summon monsters between 
Levels 3 and 7 simultaneously!

00:21:23.430 --> 00:21:25.930
Swing, my soul's pendulum.

00:21:26.400 --> 00:21:28.900
Draw a shining arc in the sky!

00:21:28.900 --> 00:21:30.620
Pendulum Summon!

00:21:31.080 --> 00:21:33.980
Appear, my monsters!

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:56.630
Five monsters at once?

00:21:56.630 --> 00:21:57.760
Are you serious?

00:21:58.100 --> 00:21:59.520
Incredible!

00:21:59.520 --> 00:22:00.560
Wow!

00:22:07.110 --> 00:22:10.200
I'm fighting with everyone!

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:52.940
Right now, everyone in City 
is focused on this duel.

00:23:52.940 --> 00:23:56.050
If you want to reach them, now is the time!

00:23:56.050 --> 00:23:58.490
No matter how small each 
of our voices might be,

00:23:58.490 --> 00:24:02.220
all voices, together, will resonate in your heart!

00:24:02.630 --> 00:24:04.940
Bring it on, Yuya Sakaki.

00:24:04.940 --> 00:24:07.490
See your duel through to the end.

00:24:07.830 --> 00:24:10.310
I'll accept it with everything I have!

00:24:11.350 --> 00:24:14.930
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
To a Single Road.

00:24:15.360 --> 00:24:17.300
The fun is only getting started!
